SBOM Upload App
===============

A small, self-hosted Node.js + TypeScript web frontend that wraps the
SBOM extractor from the upstream project TomTonic/extract-sbom.

Original SBOM extractor:
    TomTonic/extract-sbom
    https://github.com/TomTonic/extract-sbom
    BSD 3-Clause License, Copyright (c) 2026 Tom Tonic

This repository:
    The Node/TypeScript code under src/, public/src/, scripts/, tests/
    and the build configuration are licensed under the MIT License (see
    LICENSE). All credit for the SBOM extraction logic, the supply-chain
    audit format, and the underlying tool design belongs to the upstream
    project linked above.

